  "id": 1034,
  "description": "# Welcome to the Back Bulls!\n\n🔥 &quot;PUSH PAST YOUR LIMITS! RIGHT HERE, RIGHT NOW!&quot; 🔥\n\n Are you ready to unleash your inner magic? 🌟 **THE BLACK BULLS** are looking for fierce magic knights to join our chaotic but unstoppable family! Led by our beloved Captain **Owly**, we are a combat-oriented guild that fights hard and chills harder. ⚔️\n\n## 💥 WHY JOIN OUR SQUAD? 💥\n• 🩸 **A Boundless Family:** We have a strong, mature core of members. Our relationships are magic—they carry on way longer than our actual stay in Idle MMO. We are a long-lasting family! 🤝\n\n• 🏰 **Calculated Assaults:** We are a highly active guild when it comes to raids and assaults! Captain Yami... well, **Owly**, carefully chooses Zones where most members can participate together. No one who tries to help will ever be left alone in the dirt! 🦾\n\n## 💪 OUR GROWTH FOCUS 💪\n \nOur goals are as simple as Asta&#039;s brain: **Become the strongest, best versions of ourselves, and have loads of fun doing it!** 🚀\n\nRight now, we are managing **4 active parties** in the combat leagues. We love some friendly internal rivalry—we compete among ourselves to score as high as humanly possible! 🏆\n\n## ⚠️ GUILD REQUIREMENTS ⚠️\n\nCaptains are great, but  we need you to pull your weight! 🚬\n\n• 🎮 Joining our **Discord** is mandatory: https://discord.gg/qctcDDpKn8\n\n• ⚡ **Be Active:** We expect daily grinding and participation. When the drums of war sound, assault participation is **MANDATORY** if the guild staff evaluates you as fit for battle!\n\n• 🪙 **Stockpile Contribution:** Regular guildies are expected to  contribute on daily basis.\n\n• ⚔️ **Combat Level:** We highly prefer **CL80+** players. However, if we see that fierce *Anti-Magic potential* inside you, we gladly recruit lower combat level players too!\n\n## 👇 HOW TO JOIN THE CHAOS: 👇\n\nIf you are ready to cause some trouble on the leaderboards, don&#039;t just stand there! \n\n📩 **DM Owly or FeitasMax right now and show us your grit!** 🍀",
